1
00:00:00,798 --> 00:00:02,338
(Howard:)What happened to your thumb?

2
00:00:02,508 --> 00:00:04,508
Yeah, I have ten fingers
and ten toes.

3
00:00:04,719 --> 00:00:08,809
If I tell you a story about each of them,
we'll be here all day. Let's move on.

4
00:00:10,141 --> 00:00:11,601
- What can I get you?
- Ah.

5
00:00:11,809 --> 00:00:15,729
(Sheldon:)Seeing as I'm on vacation,
a piña colada seems appropriate.

6
00:00:15,938 --> 00:00:18,438
(Sheldon:)Extra pineapple slices,
extra whipped cream...

7
00:00:18,649 --> 00:00:22,859
(Sheldon:)...extra cherries, extra umbrellas,
and, uh, hold the rum.

8
00:00:24,363 --> 00:00:26,743
Don't Iet me have too many of those.

9
00:00:27,283 --> 00:00:29,203
(Penny:)Hey. What are you guys doing here?

10
00:00:29,368 --> 00:00:32,368
(Howard:)We're grown men.
We drink at bars, heh.

11
00:00:32,913 --> 00:00:34,833
(Penny:)No and no.

12
00:00:37,126 --> 00:00:38,956
(Penny:)Everything okay
with you and Bernadette?

13
00:00:39,170 --> 00:00:41,460
(Howard:)Oh, yeah, sure.

14
00:00:41,672 --> 00:00:45,172
- You and Amy? Good?
- Oh, better than good.

15
00:00:46,385 --> 00:00:49,515
(Penny:)Those girls text me every detail
of their lives as it happens.

16
00:00:49,680 --> 00:00:52,020
(Howard:)I'm not signing a prenup.

17
00:00:52,516 --> 00:00:56,186
All right, wolowitz, listen up. You
sign anything she puts in front of you.

18
00:00:56,395 --> 00:00:58,145
(Penny:)You are the luckiest man alive.

